data: {"id": "1031865669664b80-thinking-parallel_evidence-2206", "run_id": "1031865669664b80", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我来分析已采集的事实，并处理日志查询失败的问题。\n\n## 事实与证据分析\n\n### 实体身份确认\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-01`\n- **Pod**: `workload-68c557d875-llhkh`\n- **状态**: `Pending`，`node: <none>` —— **未被调度到任何节点**\n- **控制器**: `ReplicaSet/workload-68c557d875`\n\n### 根因证据（PendingUnschedulable）\n\n**支持的直接原因**：Pod 的 NodeSelector 为 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`，而集群 3 个节点均无此 label，导致调度器无法匹配任何节点。事件明确记录：\n\n> `FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.`\n\n这解释了 Pod 为何长期处于 Pending 状态。\n\n### 日志查询失败说明\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788409904519, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

